  "description": "This application is for:\n1. New rear single storey kitchen extension, \n2. New loft room with shower, \n3. New front porch and a \n4. New rear garden garage/workshop.\nThe existing rear timber structure will be demolished the existing rear timber structure and to replace this with a new masonry constructed cavity wall extension complete with insulations and a warm flat roof. This will also include a new set of bi folding doors and a single door to the rear elevation.\nInternally there will be a few minor adjustments with the addition of a new staircase leading from the first floor to the loft area with a new loft room created.\nThe existing side access way will be retained to allow the vehicles to access through to the new rear garage.",
